#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: widgets-for-google-reviews-and-ratings.php
msgid "Widgets for Google Business Reviews and Ratings"
msgstr "Widgets für Google Business-Bewertungen und -Rezensionen"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: widgets-for-google-reviews-and-ratings.php
msgid "https://repocean.com/"
msgstr "https://repocean.com/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: widgets-for-google-reviews-and-ratings.php
msgid ""
"Quickly and easily embed Google reviews into your WordPress site. Boost SEO, "
"build trust, and increase sales with Google reviews."
msgstr ""
"Binden Sie Google-Bewertungen schnell und einfach in Ihre WordPress-Seite "
"ein. Verbessern Sie SEO, bauen Sie Vertrauen auf und steigern Sie den Umsatz "
"mit Google-Bewertungen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: widgets-for-google-reviews-and-ratings.php
msgid "repocean"
msgstr "repocean"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: widgets-for-google-reviews-and-ratings.php
msgid "https://profiles.wordpress.org/repocean/"
msgstr "https://profiles.wordpress.org/repocean/"

